{"id":"019af49a70a303e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Greatest Element","display":"df-zfc-order2-greatest-element — ZFC Order2 Greatest Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element","58-df-zfc-order6-greatest-element"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-greatest-element — ZFC Order2 Greatest Element","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-greatest-element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-greatest-element — ZFC Order2 Greatest Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,A,\\leq_P,X,R,g\\in V\">\\(m,A,\\leq_P,X,R,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S(m,A,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(A,\\leq_P)\\land m\\in A\\land \\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S(m,A,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(A,\\leq_P)\\land m\\in A\\land \\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S(X,R,A,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land g\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,g\\rangle\\in R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S(X,R,A,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land g\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,g\\rangle\\in R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both variants require the displayed relation to be a partial order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,A,\\leq_P,X,R,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2GreatestElement}_S(m,A,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(A,\\leq_P)\\land m\\in A\\land \\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}greatest\\text{-}element\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6GreatestElement}_S(X,R,A,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land g\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,g\\rangle\\in R","display":true}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2931","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element.md|58-df-zfc-order2-greatest-element]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}